# Katalyst — contexto de build mínimo (BuildKit usa <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). RNF-SEG-01: nunca
# enviar secretos, state de Terraform ni artefactos locales al contexto de build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfplan
**/.terraform
**/crash.log
.git
infra
docs
Especificación_Requerimientos
qa-tests/test-results
qa-tests/playwright-report
**/storageState*.json
**/.auth
